        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Robert Holdstock, H. L. Mencken\n- Works: Mythago Wood\n- Roles: Novelist, author, journalist, satirist, cultural critic, scholar\n- Topics: Mythic fiction, fantasy literature, American English\n\nFacts:\n- H. L. Mencken was born on September 12, 1880, and died on January 29, 1956.\n- H. L. Mencken was an American journalist, satirist, cultural critic, and scholar of American English.\n- Robert Holdstock was born on August 2, 1948, and died on November 29, 2009.\n- Robert Holdstock was an English novelist and author best known for Celtic, Nordic, Gothic, and Pictish fantasy literature, mainly in the mythic fiction subgenre.\n- Mythago Wood is a fantasy novel by British writer Robert Holdstock.\n- Mythago Wood was published in the United Kingdom in 1984.",
